  "description": "Hi everyone,\n\nBelow is a concise reference for the three Player\u2019s Handbook spells we\u2019ll be using in the upcoming session. **Fireball** has a Dexterity saving throw, deals\u202f8d6 fire damage in a 20\u2011ft\u2011radius sphere, and its damage increases by\u202f1d6 for each higher spell slot (one extra die per slot). **Cure\u202fWounds** provides\u202f1d8 healing, also scales by\u202f1d8 for each higher slot (one extra die per slot), and you may add your casting modifier to the total healed amount. **Lightning\u202fBolt** likewise requires a Dexterity save, inflicts\u202f8d6 lightning damage along a 100\u2011ft line, and its damage progression mirrors Fireball\u2019s \u2013\u202f1d6 additional damage per higher slot (one extra die per slot). All three spells are sourced from the Player\u2019s Handbook."
